      q: "Let U = {1,2,…,n}. Let A = {(x,X) | x ∈ X, X ⊆ U}. Consider the following two statements on |A|.\nI. |A| = n·2^(n−1)\nII. |A| = Σ_{k=1}^{n} k·C(n,k)\nWhich of the above statements is/are TRUE?",
